\id ACT
\c 19
\p
\v 39 But if you seek anything about other matters, it will be settled in the regular assembly.
\v 40 For indeed we are in danger of being accused concerning today’s riot.
\v 41 When he had thus spoken, he dismissed the assembly.
\c 20
\p
\v 1 After the uproar had ceased, Paul sent for the disciples.
